# Webpack output. Generated into the module's resources by `yarn build`, which Maven runs at
# generate-resources, so every build produces it and `mvn clean` already deletes it (see the
# maven-clean-plugin fileset in pom.xml). Tracking it meant `mvn clean` removed committed files
# and every local build re-dirtied the tree with freshly hashed names.
